# 🧠 TODAY'S MASTER FORMULA CARD

### One-day work

$$
\boxed{\frac1{Total\ Days}}
$$

### Work relationship

$$
\boxed{Work=Rate\times Time}
$$

### Combined rate

$$
\boxed{\frac1x+\frac1y}
$$

### Two people together

$$
\boxed{\frac{xy}{x+y}}
$$

### Efficiency and time

$$
\boxed{Efficiency\propto\frac1{Time}}
$$

### Workers

$$
\boxed{Men\times Days=Constant}
$$

### Workers + hours

$$
\boxed{Men\times Days\times Hours=Constant}
$$

### Pipes

```text
Filling → +
Emptying → −
```

---

# 🔥 QUICK IDENTIFICATION TRICK

When you see a question, ask:

### 👷 Workers?

➡️ Use **efficiency/work rate**.

### 🚰 Pipes?

➡️ Same concept:

**Fill = +, Empty = −**

### 👥 More workers, fewer days?

➡️ **Inverse proportion**

### 🕒 Hours also change?

➡️ Use:

$$
Men\times Days\times Hours
$$

### 🚪 Someone leaves midway?

➡️ Use the **LCM work method**.

